# excalibur-backports Release has Suite=stable-backports, Codename=excalibur-backports:
# pin with n= (codename); a=excalibur-backports silently matches nothing.
Package: linux-image-amd64 linux-image-7.* linux-headers-amd64 linux-headers-7.* linux-kbuild-7.* linux-libc-dev linux-base
Pin: release n=excalibur-backports
Pin-Priority: 600

Package: pipewire pipewire-* libpipewire-* libspa-* gstreamer1.0-pipewire wireplumber wireplumber-* libwireplumber-* gir1.2-wp-*
Pin: release n=excalibur-backports
Pin-Priority: 600

Package: quickshell quickshell-*
Pin: release n=excalibur-backports
Pin-Priority: 600

# rustup itself comes from main; toolchains are per-user via rustup.

# XLibre's video drivers (xserver-xlibre-video-amdgpu >= 25.10) need
# mesa >= 25.2.6; trixie/excalibur has 25.0.x, backports has the new one.
Package: mesa-* libgl1-mesa-dri libglx-mesa0 libegl-mesa0 libgbm1 libgbm-dev libosmesa6 libxatracker2 libd3dadapter9-mesa libdrm* libwayland-* libgallium*
Pin: release n=excalibur-backports
Pin-Priority: 600

# Firmware for new hardware (AMD/Intel GPUs, Intel/Realtek/MediaTek Wi-Fi and
# Bluetooth, Intel SOF/Cirrus laptop audio, Intel ISH sensors): the binary
# packages of the firmware-nonfree source, by name, from backports. All of
# them, so they stay on one upstream drop: firmware-linux-nonfree depends on
# firmware-misc-nonfree and firmware-amd-graphics with "=" versions. Only
# installed (or explicitly requested) ones are affected; nothing else in
# backports is pulled in. firmware-qcom-media (another drop, ARM SoCs) and
# firmware-nvidia-gsp (another source) are left out; firmware-sof-signed and
# firmware-linux-free have no backports build. Idea from LCOS
# (lcos-live config/archives/lcos-amd-backports.pref.chroot).
Package: firmware-linux firmware-linux-nonfree firmware-misc-nonfree firmware-amd-graphics firmware-nvidia-graphics firmware-intel-graphics firmware-intel-misc firmware-intel-sound firmware-iwlwifi firmware-realtek firmware-mediatek firmware-atheros firmware-brcm80211 firmware-cirrus firmware-libertas firmware-ti-connectivity firmware-ipw2x00 firmware-samsung firmware-siano firmware-ivtv firmware-bnx2 firmware-bnx2x firmware-cavium firmware-myricom firmware-netronome firmware-netxen firmware-qlogic firmware-marvell-prestera firmware-qcom-soc
Pin: release n=excalibur-backports
Pin-Priority: 600
